  "title": "Jack and Lou: A Gangster Love Story",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Jack and Lou: A Gangster Love Story is a six-episode audio drama podcast starring Lisa Kudrow. The story is about love in Al Capone’s Chicago. It is inspired by the true story of Louise Rolfe, aka The Blonde Alibi, (Lisa Kudrow) and Jack McGurn, aka Machine Gun Jack McGurn, (Leigh Joel Scott). The two were involved in the famous trial after the St. Valentine's Day Massacre in 1929. Based on a story by John Watson. Produced by Yeon Jin Lee, Mehmet Gungoren. Sound supervised by Audrey Gu, Cabba Cai. Original music composed by David Myles Lewis.",
